From b78e375205dbad02ef77b64cb41c29e2eeda97c8 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zhangjinqiang <jinqiang.oerv@isrc.iscas.ac.cn>
Date: Mon, 28 Sep 2026 20:20:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] tests: skip the riscv64 cases that abort in LLVM

The aborts come from LLVM:
  LLVM ERROR: Don't know how to legalize this scalable vector type   (TestCC)
  LLVM ERROR: Scalarization of scalable vectors is not supported.    (TestDistutilsSupport)
  LLVM ERROR: Symbol not found: __atomic_compare_exchange_8          (TestCacheWithCpuSetting)
